{
	"name": "Giant Aspect",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/sundries/flags/banner-standard-moon.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p><strong>Passive Effect:</strong> You count as one size larger when determining your carrying capacity, and have advantage against being knocked prone by creatures of size Medium or smaller.</p><p><strong>Active Effect: </strong><em><strong>Sweeping Strike.</strong></em> When you make a melee attack that would normally target one creature, you can also target other creatures within 10ft of you, up to a maximum of 3 creatures. Any creature who gets hit by this attack is knocked back 10ft, causing 1d10 bludgeoning damage to any creature in its way. Creatures who are bowled over in such a manner must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your Maneuver DC or fall [[/condition id=prone]].</p>",
